<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Article Title - SDTM</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #e0e0e0;
            background: #0a0a0a;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f3460 0%, #16213e 50%, #1a1a2e 100%);
            padding: 40px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.2);
        }

        .back-link {
            color: #0ea5e9;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .back-link:hover {
            color: #8b5cf6;
        }

        .article-header {
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .article-title {
            font-size: 2.8em;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9 0%, #8b5cf6 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .article-meta {
            display: flex;
            gap: 25px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 1em;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .article-meta span {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .article-content {
            padding: 60px 40px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #0f172a 100%);
        }

        .article-content h2 {
            color: #0ea5e9;
            font-size: 2em;
            margin-top: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .article-content h3 {
            color: #8b5cf6;
            font-size: 1.5em;
            margin-top: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .article-content p {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            line-height: 1.9;
        }

        .article-content ul, .article-content ol {
            margin-left: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        .article-content li {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 1.05em;
        }

        .article-content code {
            background: rgba(15, 52, 96, 0.6);
            padding: 3px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            color: #0ea5e9;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 0.95em;
        }

        .article-content pre {
            background: rgba(15, 52, 96, 0.6);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow-x: auto;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.2);
        }

        .article-content pre code {
            background: none;
            padding: 0;
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        .article-content blockquote {
            border-left: 4px solid #0ea5e9;
            padding-left: 20px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-style: italic;
            background: rgba(15, 52, 96, 0.3);
            padding: 15px 20px;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
        }

        .article-content img {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .article-content a {
            color: #0ea5e9;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .article-content a:hover {
            color: #8b5cf6;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .highlight-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.1) 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1) 100%);
            border: 1px solid rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.3);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }

        .tags {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-top: 30px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.2);
        }

        .tag {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9 0%, #0284c7 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        footer {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.2);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .article-title {
                font-size: 2em;
            }

            .article-content {
                padding: 40px 20px;
            }

            header {
                padding: 20px;
            }

            .article-meta {
                font-size: 0.9em;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <a href="index.html" class="back-link">← Back to Main Page</a>
            <div class="article-header">
                <h1 class="article-title">[ARTICLE TITLE: Replace with your article title]</h1>
                <div class="article-meta">
                    <span>📅 [DATE: e.g., January 5, 2025]</span>
                    <span>⏱️ [READING TIME: e.g., 5 min read]</span>
                    <span>✍️ Sukrit Dass TM</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="article-content">
            <!-- Introduction -->
            <p>[INTRODUCTION: Write an engaging introduction that hooks the reader and provides context for your article. Explain why this topic matters and what readers will learn.]</p>

            <!-- Main Section 1 -->
            <h2>[SECTION 1 HEADING: Replace with your first main section heading]</h2>
            <p>[SECTION 1 CONTENT: Write your content here. You can use multiple paragraphs to explain concepts clearly.]</p>
            
            <p>[Additional paragraph if needed. Break down complex ideas into digestible chunks.]</p>

            <!-- Highlight Box Example -->
            <div class="highlight-box">
                <strong>💡 Key Insight:</strong> [HIGHLIGHT: Use this box to emphasize important points, definitions, or key takeaways that you want readers to remember.]
            </div>

            <!-- Main Section 2 -->
            <h2>[SECTION 2 HEADING: Your second main section]</h2>
            <p>[SECTION 2 CONTENT: Continue your article with the next major topic or subtopic.]</p>

            <!-- Subsection Example -->
            <h3>[SUBSECTION HEADING: A more specific topic within Section 2]</h3>
            <p>[SUBSECTION CONTENT: Provide detailed information about this subtopic.]</p>

            <!-- List Example -->
            <h3>[LIST HEADING: When you need to present multiple points]</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>[POINT 1: First item in your list]</li>
                <li>[POINT 2: Second item]</li>
                <li>[POINT 3: Third item]</li>
                <li>[Add more points as needed]</li>
            </ul>

            <!-- Code Example (if applicable) -->
            <h3>[CODE HEADING: If your article includes technical content]</h3>
            <p>[Explanation before code]</p>
            <pre><code>[CODE BLOCK: 
Replace with your code, equations, or technical content
Line 2
Line 3]</code></pre>

            <!-- Quote Example -->
            <blockquote>
                [QUOTE: Use this for important quotes, definitions from literature, or emphasized statements. Include attribution if quoting someone else.]
            </blockquote>

            <!-- Main Section 3 -->
            <h2>[SECTION 3 HEADING: Your third major topic]</h2>
            <p>[SECTION 3 CONTENT: Continue building your article with additional sections as needed.]</p>

            <!-- Applications/Implications -->
            <h2>[APPLICATIONS HEADING: Real-world applications or implications]</h2>
            <p>[Discuss practical applications, real-world examples, or implications of the topic you're discussing.]</p>

            <ol>
                <li><strong>[Application 1]:</strong> [Description of first application]</li>
                <li><strong>[Application 2]:</strong> [Description of second application]</li>
                <li><strong>[Application 3]:</strong> [Description of third application]</li>
            </ol>

            <!-- Challenges/Future Directions -->
            <h2>[CHALLENGES HEADING: Current challenges or future directions]</h2>
            <p>[Discuss current limitations, challenges, or future research directions in this field.]</p>

            <!-- Conclusion -->
            <h2>Conclusion</h2>
            <p>[CONCLUSION: Summarize the key points of your article. Reinforce the main takeaways and perhaps suggest next steps or further reading for interested readers.]</p>

            <!-- References (Optional) -->
            <h2>References</h2>
            <ol>
                <li>[Reference 1: Author, Title, Journal/Source, Year]</li>
                <li>[Reference 2: Add your references here]</li>
                <li>[Reference 3: Include DOI or URL if available]</li>
            </ol>

            <!-- Tags -->
            <div class="tags">
                <span class="tag">[TAG1: e.g., Materials Science]</span>
                <span class="tag">[TAG2: e.g., Nanotechnology]</span>
                <span class="tag">[TAG3: e.g., ALD]</span>
                <span class="tag">[TAG4: Add relevant tags]</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer>
            <p>&copy; 2025 Sukrit Dass Thirukonda Muralidoss. All rights reserved.</p>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
